   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1969-76ve15p2",
   "documentId": "d292",
   "text": "Such payments coming when Strauss was Defense Minister paved the way for the sale of the Starfighter to the FRG."
  },
  {
   "kind": "document",
   "volumeId": "frus1969-76ve15p2",
   "documentId": "d293",
   "notes": [
