   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1969-76ve15p2",
   "documentId": "d293",
   "text": "We must do everything possible to keep this quiet. If the CSU is destroyed in Germany it will really shake Germany and strengthen the left."
