   "kind": "prose",
   "text": "The disclosures moved into economic diplomacy: in 1976 officials asked whether to raise bribery at the economic summit, and by 1977–1978 Carter's economic officials counted the U.S. proposal for an international agreement on illicit payments as one of the few North–South issues on which Washington held the initiative."
  },
